      "code": "F26B9/066",
      "level": 9,
      "parent": "F26B9/06",
      "ja": "｛被乾燥製品が少なくとも部分的にガス前壁部を有する１個以上の容器上に配置されるもの，例．スタック中のトレイまたは棚（Ｆ２６Ｂ９／００３が優先；管路式との組み合わせＦ２６Ｂ２１／００）｝",
      "en": "{the products to be dried being disposed on one or more containers, which may have at least partly gas-previous walls, e.g. trays or shelves in a stack (F26B9/003 takes precedence; in combination with duct systems F26B21/00)}",
